        "name": "Bucharest Palace of Parliament and Old Town",
        "description": "The second-largest administrative building in the world and the lively Lipscani quarter.",
        "details": "The Palace of Parliament was built under Ceausescu and is visited on a guided tour with passport. The Old Town has Stavropoleos church, the Hanul lui Manuc inn and cafes. The Village Museum shows peasant houses from across the country.",
        "interests": [
          "culture",
          "iconic_landmarks",
